    "Everything Safira decided for you, and where to change it. Nothing is sent without an action of yours. Web content switches apply to %@, and to pages opened from now on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Everything Safira decided for you, and where to change it. Nothing is sent without an action of yours. Web content switches apply to %@, and to pages opened from now on."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tout ce que Safira a choisi pour vous, et où le modifier. Rien n’est envoyé sans une action de votre part. Les réglages du contenu web s’appliquent à %@, et aux pages ouvertes à partir de maintenant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything “%@” holds is erased: its logins, cookies and website data, its history, its Spaces and Tabs, and its settings. This cannot be undone." : {
      "comment" : "Alert text of Delete Profile; the argument is the Profile name",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Everything “%@” holds is erased: its logins, cookies and website data, its history, its Spaces and Tabs, and its settings. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tout ce que contient « %@ » est effacé : ses identifiants, ses cookies et ses données de sites, son historique, ses espaces et ses onglets, et ses réglages. Cette action est irréversible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
