    },
    "Safira erases it the next time it opens." : {
      "comment" : "Main window",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Safira erases it the next time it opens."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Safira les effacera à sa prochaine ouverture."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Safira keeps your Profiles apart: each has its own logins, history and settings. In a few steps you create the first one, choose a search engine and a set of shortcuts, and see every default Safira picked, each of which you can change." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Safira keeps your Profiles apart: each has its own logins, history and settings. In a few steps you create the first one, choose a search engine and a set of shortcuts, and see every default Safira picked, each of which you can change."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Safira sépare vos profils : chacun a ses propres identifiants, son historique et ses réglages. En quelques étapes, vous créez le premier, choisissez un moteur de recherche et un ensemble de raccourcis, et voyez tous les choix faits par défaut par Safira, que vous pouvez chacun modifier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Safira never overwrites it. No rule applies until it is fixed: links go to the Link picker. Fix it in an editor, or delete it to start again." : {
      "comment" : "Link rules window",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Safira never overwrites it. No rule applies until it is fixed: links go to the Link picker. Fix it in an editor, or delete it to start again."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Safira ne l’écrase jamais. Aucune règle ne s’applique tant qu’il n’est pas corrigé : les liens passent par le sélecteur de liens. Corrigez-le dans un éditeur, ou supprimez-le pour repartir de zéro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
